# ── OAuth Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# This file is the source of truth for your 42 OAuth credentials.
# It is gitignored and survives `make nuke` — fill it in once, keep it.
#
# First-time setup:
#   1. Go to https://profile.intra.42.fr/oauth/applications
#   2. Create an application and copy the UID and Secret
#   3. Copy this file: cp oauth-credentials.conf.example oauth-credentials.conf
#   4. Open oauth-credentials.conf and fill in your values
#   5. Run `make setup` — it will write the values into secrets/
#	6. Make sure you never push oauth-credentials.conf!
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

FORTYTWO_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
FORTYTWO_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
